Private medical-cloud attachment SDK assembly.

Contains relocated MinIO Java SDK 8.6.0 and Jackson annotations 2.21,
core/databind 2.21.7, under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Upstream license/notice resources are retained/merged in META-INF.

Original coordinates and source SHA-256 are recorded in
META-INF/medcloud-attachment-sdk.properties. MinIO's published runtime
version marker reports "dev"; provenance relies on the resolved Maven
coordinate, captured source JAR bytes, and recorded checksum.

Relocation changes package names and references only. It does not
patch container-provided RESTEasy/Jackson or certify dependency safety.
Forwarded dependencies remain separately packaged with their own notices.
